    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class="spiral-ring"></div>
    <div class="spiral-ring"></div><div class=""></div>
  </div>

  <div class="page-content">

    <!-- 三、防治原则 -->
    <div class="top-section">
      <h2>三、防治原则</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>尿路感染：首季多饮水，或口服<span class="boxed-text">呋喃妥因</span></li>
        <li>心内膜炎、脑膜炎：<span class="highlight-box">青霉素或氨苄西林与氨基糖苷类联合用药效果较好</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="separator">

    <!-- 第四节 奈瑟菌属 -->
    <div class="main-section">
      <h2>第四节 奈瑟菌属</h2>

      <!-- 一、脑膜炎奈瑟菌 -->
      <h3>一、脑膜炎奈瑟菌</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="highlight-box-blue">G⁻</span>，肾形双排列</li>
        <li>有荚膜和菌毛</li>
        <li>无芽胞，无鞭毛</li>
        <li>专性需氧</li>
        <li>营养要求高</li>
        <li>在<span class="boxed-blue">巧克力色培养基</span>上生长良好</li>
        <li>初次分离需要5%~10% CO₂</li>
        <li>分解葡萄糖和麦芽糖，不产酸</li>
        <li>氧化酶试验阳性</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- 二、致病物质 -->
      <h3>二、致病物质</h3>
      <ol class="numbered-list">
        <li><span class="pink-box">荚膜</span>：有抗吞噬作用，能增强细菌的侵袭力</li>
        <li><span class="pink-box">菌毛</span>：可黏附到鼻咽部黏膜上皮细胞表面</li>
        <li><span class="pink-box">内毒素</span>：是主要致病物质</li>
        <li><span class="pink-box">自溶酶</span>：使细菌自溶，释放内毒素</li>
      </ol>

      <!-- 三、所致疾病 -->
      <h3>三、所致疾病</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="highlight-box">流行性脑脊髓膜炎（流脑）</span></li>
        <li>普通型占90%，病程分期：</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="disease-flow">
        <span class="box">上呼吸道感染期</span>
        <span class="arr">→</span>
        <span class="box">败血症期</span>
        <span class="arr">→</span>
        <span class="box">脑膜炎期</span>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <li>大量毒素释放入血引起毒血症</li>
        <li>入血引起菌血症或败血症</li>
        <li>累及脑膜，恶心、呕吐和皮肤瘀点瘀斑</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- 四、免疫性 -->
      <h3>四、免疫性</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>以<span class="green-box">体液免疫</span>为主</li>
        <li>以IgM、IgG为主</li>
        <li>病后免疫力不牢固</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- 五、微生物学检查 -->
      <h3>五、微生物学检查</h3>
      <div class="table-like">
        <span class="label">标本：</span>
        <span>脑脊液、血液、瘀斑渗出液</span>
        <span class="label">直接涂片：</span>
        <span>革兰阴性双球菌，中性粒细胞内</span>
        <span class="label">分离培养：</span>
        <span>巧克力色培养基，5%~10% CO₂</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 六、防治原则 -->
      <h3>六、防治原则</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span class="highlight-box">流脑疫苗</span></li>
        <li>治疗：<span class="boxed-text">青霉素G</span>，<span class="boxed-text">磺胺嘧啶（SD）</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="separator">

    <!-- 淋病奈瑟菌 -->
    <div class="gn-section">
      <div class="gn-title">淋病奈瑟菌（淋球菌）</div>

      <h4>一、生物学性状</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>G⁻，肾形双排列，有荚膜和菌毛</li>
        <li>营养要求高，在巧克力色培养基上生长</li>
        <li>初次分离需5%~10% CO₂</li>
        <li>只分解葡萄糖，不分解麦芽糖</li>
        <li>氧化酶试验阳性</li>
      </ul>

      <h4>二、致病物质</h4>
      <ol class="numbered-list">
        <li>菌毛：黏附尿道/宫颈黏膜上皮细胞</li>
        <li>外膜蛋白：抑制吞噬</li>
        <li>IgA蛋白酶：破坏黏膜表面IgA</li>
        <li>内毒素：引起炎症反应</li>
      </ol>

      <h4>三、所致疾病</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>通过性接触传播</li>
        <li>男性：尿道炎（尿痛、脓性分泌物）</li>
        <li>女性：宫颈炎、盆腔炎（症状较轻，易被忽视）</li>
        <li>新生儿：<span class="highlight-box">结膜炎（脓漏眼）</span></li>
      </ul>

      <h4>四、微生物学检查</h4>
      <div class="table-like">
        <span class="label">标本：</span>
        <span>尿道/宫颈分泌物</span>
        <span class="label">直接涂片：</span>
        <span>革兰阴性双球菌，白细胞内</span>
        <span class="label">分离培养：</span>
        <span>巧克力色培养基，CO₂环境</span>
      </div>

      <h4>五、防治原则</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>加强性卫生教育</li>
        <li>治疗：<span class="boxed-text">头孢曲松</span>、<span class="boxed-text">大观霉素</span></li>
        <li>新生儿预防：出生后用<span class="boxed-text">硝酸银</span>滴眼</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

</body>
